{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":1426,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Blind_Faith","title":"Blind Faith"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["MAP"]}]}]},{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Blind_Faith/Story"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["STORY"]}]}]}]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["\n\n"]},{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["This is the story subpage for Blind Faith. It contains information about the cutscenes and an overview of the story."]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This page contains the official story elements included in Night 3, that takes place in the map ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Blind_Faith","title":"Blind Faith"},"children":["Blind Faith"]}," during the Null & Void Event. Most of the content is expressed through cutscenes, though some dialogue is important to the storyline."]},"\n\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Story_Overview"},"children":["Story Overview"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This is the third night for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Null_&_Void_Event","title":"Null & Void Event"},"children":["Null & Void Event"]},". It takes place immediately after the events of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Banlands","title":"Banlands"},"children":["Banlands"]},", the second night."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunner"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," arrive in some broken down church. Through various dialogue, like the Wave 12 and 21 dialogue, it can be concluded that this is located inside the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nil_Zone","title":"Nil Zone"},"children":["Nil Zone"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["In here, they see the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]}," successfully fighting off the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Children_of_Exo","title":"Children of Exo"},"children":["Children of Exo"]},". As he is about to cast a spell, he is grabbed by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Right_Hand","title":"Right Hand"},"children":["Righty"]},". The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]},", who was playing dead, escapes away from ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," and blocks bullets using ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Left_Hand","title":"Left Hand"},"children":["Lefty"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["While the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]}," is held by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Right_Hand","title":"Right Hand"},"children":["Righty"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Kronus","title":"Kronus"},"children":["Kronus"]}," rebuilds the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," by merging their half of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," with the one the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," collected. Using the just created ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," powered staff, he begins to prepare the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]},"'s body to be taken over by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," by corrupting him with the staff."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["While the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Children_of_Exo","title":"Children of Exo"},"children":["Children of Exo"]}," are preparing ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]},"'s rebirth, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," fights off hordes of null enemies. During this, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," hears or gets into conversations with their enemies, revealing many at the time unknown things about the past, like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," being responsible for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," finding a fragment."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Once enough energy has been put into the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Kronus","title":"Kronus"},"children":["Kronus"]}," stops corrupting him and attempts to take down the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," agents himself as revenge for not saving ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Trick_or_Threat_Town","title":"Trick or Threat Town"},"children":["Trick or Threat Town"]},", though he is defeated. Around this time, they also rebuild the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Star_Cannon","title":"Star Cannon"},"children":["Star Cannon"]}," which fell down from the sky and broke upon landing."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["By the final wave, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]}," could not fully resist the corruption, allowing for ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," to possess him. While now with a body, the current one still is resisting him, but this does not concern him at the moment. Instead, he decides to fight the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},", which ends with his defeat."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Defeated ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]},", realizing that the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]}," is not a suitable host for his soul decides to find another body to possess. He decides that ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Kronus","title":"Kronus"},"children":["Kronus"]}," is the most ideal option he has and begins transferring his soul to him. His brothers shocked by this do not want that to happen and even attack the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," for breaking the deal they had with him."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Eventually, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Kronus","title":"Kronus"},"children":["Kronus"]}," gives up and lets ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," use him as his body. Now with a more suitable body, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]}," has been reborn. He starts out by pulling out a blade and then puts the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]}," in chains, kidnapping her. Immediately after, he ends up stabbing the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rift_Walker_(Story)","title":"Rift Walker (Story)"},"children":["Rift Walker"]},", who has been weakened by the fight he unwillingly got into while possessed, killing him."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunner"]}," end up being sucked into an orange portal, preventing them from doing anything to save the situation. This portal shortly after turns out to be ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Professor_V","title":"Professor V"},"children":["Professor V"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]},", who have found a way to open up a portal to their location. While done in good faith, this leads to the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," being unable to save the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]},". The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]}," starts crying while the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]}," looks up at the sky, to see multiple rifts have opened up."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The turns black. The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," starts talking to ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lord_Exo","title":"Lord Exo"},"children":["Lord Exo"]},", and while he does not mind the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," continuing what he has been doing, he no longer sees any use from him. Saddened by this, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," leaves and ends up inviting the player to his premiere, ending the last cutscene."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwTg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Opening_Cutscene"},"children":["Opening Cutscene"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwTw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwUA"},"children":[]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwVA"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Synopsis"},"children":["Synopsis"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The following summarizes the events shown in the opening cutscene."]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwVg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwVw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Synopsis"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwWQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunner"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Narrator_(Story)","title":"Narrator (Story)"}